<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Confirmez votre email</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background:#f6f9fc; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color:#1f2937;">
    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="background:#f6f9fc; padding:30px 0;">
        <tr>
            <td align="center">
                <table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="background:#ffffff; border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(15,23,42,0.08);">
                    <tr>
                        <td style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#40C4FF,#0288D1); padding:24px;">
                            <h1 style="margin:0; color:#ffffff; font-size:22px;">SANTÉA</h1>
                            <p style="margin:6px 0 0; color:#e0f2fe; font-size:14px;">Confirmation de votre compte</p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding:28px;">
                            <h2 style="margin:0 0 10px; font-size:20px;">Confirmez votre adresse email</h2>
                            <p style="margin:0 0 14px; color:#4b5563;">Bonjour {{ user.fullName ?? user.email }},</p>
                            <p style="margin:0 0 20px; color:#4b5563;">Merci de confirmer votre adresse email pour activer votre compte.</p>
                            <p style="margin:0 0 24px;">
                                <a href="{{ verifyUrl }}" style="display:inline-block; padding:12px 20px; background:#0288D1; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; border-radius:10px; font-weight:bold;">Confirmer mon email</a>
                            </p>
                            <p style="margin:0; color:#6b7280; font-size:12px;">Ce lien expire le {{ expiresAt|date('d/m/Y H:i') }}.</p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding:18px 28px; background:#f9fafb; color:#6b7280; font-size:12px;">
                            Si vous n'êtes pas à l'origine de cette demande, ignorez ce message.
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</body>
</html>
